1
00:00:00,390 --> 00:00:03,560
(Sheldon:)Obviously, you're not that familiar
with Indian cinema.

2
00:00:08,398 --> 00:00:10,188
[DOORBELL RINGS]

3
00:00:12,027 --> 00:00:13,237
(Howard:)Who is it?

4
00:00:13,403 --> 00:00:15,613
RAJESH [IN HIGH-PITCHED VOICE]:
Stripper-gram.

5
00:00:19,284 --> 00:00:21,574
(Raj:)Tag. You're it.

6
00:00:22,371 --> 00:00:27,081
(Howard:)Shouldn't you have put him
in a brown paper bag and set him on fire?

7
00:00:29,169 --> 00:00:32,509
(Sheldon:)I've never slept on an air mattress before.

8
00:00:32,881 --> 00:00:35,761
(Sheldon:)No lumbar support whatsoever.

9
00:00:36,426 --> 00:00:40,096
(Howard:)Maybe you'd be happier on a park bench.

10
00:00:40,764 --> 00:00:43,434
(Sheldon:)I don't see any way
to get a park bench in here.

11
00:00:44,393 --> 00:00:46,853
- Do you wanna switch?
- No. That's fine.

12
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:50,440
(Sheldon:)I'm perfectly comfortable
sleeping on a bouncy castle.

13
00:00:52,859 --> 00:00:55,609
- Get out of bed. We're switching.
- Now, only if you want to.

14
00:00:55,779 --> 00:00:57,409
(Howard:)Just get in the bed.

